{"seq":3,"slug":"edge-network-dataplane-backhaul","title":"边缘网络平面、流量调度与回源互联","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/edge-platform-architecture/edge-network-dataplane-backhaul","wordCount":3080,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"边缘网络平面-流量调度与回源互联\">边缘网络平面、流量调度与回源互联</h1><p>任何一个边缘平台，最后都要回答三个网络问题：用户的第一个包从哪里进场、这个包在边缘节点内部如何被转发和决策、节点缓存未命中时如何以最低成本回到源站。这三个问题分别对应网络平面的入口调度（anycast / GSLB）、节点内数据面（XDP/eBPF、内核旁路）、以及回源互联（分层缓存、骨干回程、私有互联）。三者不是独立的子系统——入口选择决定了回程半径，数据面的转发深度决定了能否在边缘终止连接，而回源拓扑又反过来决定了哪些流量值得下沉。本文按这条链路拆开讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把边缘网络的时延预算拆开，可以看到优化空间分布在哪里。用户感知的总时延近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{total} \\approx T_{dns} + k \\cdot RTT_{access} + RTT_{backbone} + T_{processing}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ccess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ocess</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是建连所需的往返次数（TLS 1.3 通常 1–2 个 RTT，QUIC 0-RTT 可降到 0–1），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTT_{access}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ccess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由 anycast 入口点到用户的物理距离决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTT_{backbone}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是边缘节点到源站或上层缓存的距离。边缘平台的工程价值，本质是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\cdot RTT_{access}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ccess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压到最小，并用分层缓存把大部分请求的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTT_{backbone}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ba</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变成零。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    U[终端用户] --&gt;|DNS/GSLB 解析| E[最近边缘 PoP&lt;br/&gt;Anycast 入口]&#10;    E --&gt; N[节点内数据面&lt;br/&gt;XDP/eBPF 转发]&#10;    N --&gt;|缓存命中| C[(本地缓存)]&#10;    N --&gt;|缓存未命中| S[Origin Shield&lt;br/&gt;上层聚集层]&#10;    S --&gt;|仍然未命中| O[客户源站]&#10;    O --&gt;|回程| B[边缘骨干网]&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt;|TLS/QUIC 终止| U\">graph TD\n    U[终端用户] --&gt;|DNS/GSLB 解析| E[最近边缘 PoP&lt;br/&gt;Anycast 入口]\n    E --&gt; N[节点内数据面&lt;br/&gt;XDP/eBPF 转发]\n    N --&gt;|缓存命中| C[(本地缓存)]\n    N --&gt;|缓存未命中| S[Origin Shield&lt;br/&gt;上层聚集层]\n    S --&gt;|仍然未命中| O[客户源站]\n    O --&gt;|回程| B[边缘骨干网]\n    B --&gt; E\n    E --&gt;|TLS/QUIC 终止| U</pre><p>三类平面在职责上是分离的，混淆它们会导致扩展性问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平面</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n<th>关键约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>入口调度平面</td>\n<td>把用户导向最优节点</td>\n<td>Anycast BGP、GeoDNS/GSLB</td>\n<td>路由收敛速度、DNS 缓存污染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点数据面</td>\n<td>转发、终止、策略执行</td>\n<td>XDP/eBPF、DPDK、用户态 TCP 栈</td>\n<td>单机吞吐、规则更新原子性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回源互联平面</td>\n<td>未命中流量回源与聚合</td>\n<td>分层缓存、私有骨干、IXP 直连</td>\n<td>回源带宽成本、源站连接数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者失效模式互不相同，因此监控和容灾必须分开设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"anycast-与边缘入口调度\">Anycast 与边缘入口调度</h2><p>Anycast 是边缘平台最基础的入口机制：同一个 IP 前缀在多个 PoP 同时宣告，BGP 按 AS 路径长度选路，用户天然被吸入拓扑上最近的节点。Cloudflare 官方网络页列出其覆盖 <strong>348 个数据中心城市、分布于 8 个大区、100 多个国家</strong>，并与 <strong>超过 13,000 家网络运营商、云厂商和企业网络</strong> 建立互联——这种规模正是 anycast 能够近似实现「就近接入」的前提（来源：cloudflare.com/network/）。</p>\n<p>Anycast 的代价是路由不可控。BGP 只认拓扑距离，不认时延和拥塞，因此会出现「同一城市的不同 ISP 用户被吸引到相隔数百公里的不同 PoP」的情况。工程上通常用三种手段修正：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>BGP 社区（community）标记与本地优先级</strong>：向特定 transit/peer 只宣告部分前缀，人为收缩入口半径；这是「用运营手段修正路由」的标准做法，需要与运营商协商。</li>\n<li><strong>GSLB/GeoDNS 兜底</strong>：对 anycast 覆盖不佳的区域改用 DNS 返回不同 unicast 地址，实现地理与运营商维度的细粒度调度。代价是受 DNS TTL 与递归缓存影响，切换粒度以分钟计。</li>\n<li><strong>实时性能选路</strong>：Cloudflare 的 Argo Smart Routing 探测实时网络状况，把流量绕开拥塞路径，官方描述为「沿最快的网络路径转发以降低时延与丢包」，并提供开启/关闭的对比分析（来源：developers.cloudflare.com/argo-smart-routing/）。厂商通常不在产品页给出固定百分比——收益高度依赖用户与源站的地理分布。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>入口平面还有一个容易被忽略的点：<strong>连接终止位置即调度决策点</strong>。AWS Global Accelerator 用静态 anycast IP 在边缘位置承接用户流量，再走全球骨干到应用端点，官方宣称对应用与 API 工作负载可带来「最高 60%」的网络性能提升，并强调「与 DNS 无关的确定性路由」以及对 API 场景做「边缘 TCP 终止」（来源：aws.amazon.com/global-accelerator/）。静态 IP 的价值在于绕开了 DNS 缓存导致的调度失效。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>入口调度选好节点之后，这个节点在物理上究竟由哪些层级构成（PoP / site / node）决定了数据面能下沉多深，参见同章的《<a href=\"./2_pop-site-node-topology.md\"></a>边缘 PoP、Site 与节点的拓扑分层》。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"数据面转发与可编程管线\">数据面转发与可编程管线</h2><p>数据面决定了边缘节点能否在不进用户态、不建完整连接的情况下做决策。现代边缘平台普遍把转发路径分成三级：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>XDP/eBPF 层</strong>：在网卡驱动收包点执行 eBPF 程序，可在数据包进入协议栈之前完成丢弃、重定向、anycast 反向路径校验等操作。典型用途是 DDoS 清洗和 L4 负载均衡的快速路径，单机可达千万级 pps。</li>\n<li><strong>内核网络栈</strong>：处理需要完整 TCP 状态机的流量，配合 SO_REUSEPORT、连接跟踪做常规代理。</li>\n<li><strong>用户态栈</strong>：对需要自定义拥塞控制、或极高单流吞吐的场景，用 DPDK/quic-go 等把网络栈搬到用户态，绕过内核开销。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>可编程数据面的核心工程约束是<strong>规则更新的原子性</strong>。eBPF map 支持原子替换，但 tc/XDP 程序热替换需注意「新旧程序交替期间是否丢包」。生产实践通常采用 BPF map 版本切换：后端集合放进 map value，程序逻辑不变，只替换 map 内容，避免重新加载程序。</p>\n<p>转发决策依赖的健康检查必须在数据面内闭环。常见反模式是用外部 health check 服务探测后再改配置——从探测到生效的窗口里，数据面会持续把流量发给已死的后端。正确做法是把被动健康检查（基于数据面观测到的连接失败率）和主动探测都收敛到同一决策点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流量调度策略-会话保持与负载分布\">流量调度策略：会话保持与负载分布</h2><p>边缘调度必须在「全局负载均衡」和「会话确定性」之间取舍。同一个用户的多次请求如果落在不同 PoP，缓存会重复填充、会话会丢失。因此主流方案是<strong>用 client IP 做一致性哈希</strong>，而不是轮询：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 映射到一致性哈希环</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">node = \\text{hash}(clientIP \\bmod 2^{32}) \\text{ 映射到一致性哈希环}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">32</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">映射到一致性哈希环</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>引入虚拟节点（virtual node）可以显著降低节点增减时的重映射比例——从朴素的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 收敛到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。Cloudflare 的 <strong>Tiered Cache</strong> 就是用类似思路「提升缓存命中率以减少回源请求」（来源：developers.cloudflare.com 缓存文档）。</p>\n<p>调度策略可以归类为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>主要缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Anycast 就近</td>\n<td>BGP 拓扑</td>\n<td>通用入口</td>\n<td>路由不可控、跨 ISP 抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性哈希</td>\n<td>客户端 IP</td>\n<td>缓存亲和、会话保持</td>\n<td>小流量子网倾斜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最少连接数</td>\n<td>实时并发</td>\n<td>长连接、流式</td>\n<td>需要全局状态同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权轮询</td>\n<td>容量权重</td>\n<td>异构节点</td>\n<td>忽略真实负载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实操中这些策略是<strong>分层组合</strong>的：入口用 anycast 做粗调度，节点内用一致性哈希做缓存亲和，节点间用最少连接数做溢出。任何单一策略都不够。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回源互联与分层缓存\">回源互联与分层缓存</h2><p>回源是边缘平台最大的成本项与最脆弱的链路。分层缓存的动机很直接：如果边缘层缓存命中率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，上层 shield 层为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则源站实际承受的请求比例为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{origin} = R_{total} \\times (1 - h_e) \\times (1 - h_s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两者叠加的收敛效果远大于单层优化——即使每层只有 80% 命中率，源站压力也降到 4%。这就是 Fastly Origin Shield 与 Cloudflare Smart Shield / Tiered Cache 存在的理由：在多个边缘 PoP 与源站之间插入一层「聚集层」，把 N 个 PoP 的未命中请求合并为对源站的极少量请求（来源：fastly.com/products/origin-shield；来源：developers.cloudflare.com）。</p>\n<p>回程路径的选择同样关键，有三种典型拓扑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>公共互联网回源</strong>：成本最低、可控性最差，受公网拥塞和跨域路由影响。</li>\n<li><strong>私有骨干回源</strong>：边缘节点接入自有骨干网，未命中流量走内网回源。Cloudflare 与 AWS 都属此类，其暴露的优势正是「绕开公网、降低时延与丢包」。</li>\n<li><strong>IXP 直连 + PNI（私有互联）</strong>：在主要互联网交换点与运营商直接互联，减少 AS 跳数。Cloudflare 披露的 13,000+ 互联网络中很大一部分是这类直连。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>回源还有一条被低估的约束：<strong>源站连接数收敛</strong>。当边缘有数百个 PoP、每个 PoP 对源站开独立连接池时，源站会遭遇连接风暴。屏蔽层的第二个作用正是收敛连接——所有 PoP 复用 shield 到源站的少量长连接。设计回源时，必须把连接数与请求数分开评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"传输层加速与-udp-代理\">传输层加速与 UDP 代理</h2><p>边缘已经终止了 TLS，就意味着它可以在自己的骨干上使用比公网更激进的传输优化，这催生了两类机制。第一类是 <strong>QUIC/HTTP3 的多路复用与 0-RTT</strong>：QUIC 把 TLS 握手与传输握手合并，建连往返降到 1（首次）/ 0（会话恢复），直接压缩了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\cdot RTT_{access}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ccess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>；代价是 UDP 在部分企业网络被封锁，需要 HTTP/2 回退路径。</p>\n<p>第二类是 <strong>MASQUE 系协议</strong>，用于在边缘代理任意 UDP 流量。其基础是 RFC 9297 定义的 <strong>HTTP Datagrams</strong>：在 HTTP/3 上使用 QUIC DATAGRAM 帧承载不可靠、不保序的数据报，通过 <code>SETTINGS_H3_DATAGRAM=1</code> 协商；在 HTTP/1.1 或 HTTP/2（TCP）场景下则退化为 <strong>Capsule Protocol</strong>，用 <code>DATAGRAM</code> capsule（类型 <code>0x00</code>）在同一请求流上可靠保序传输（来源：RFC 9297）。RFC 9298 进一步定义 <strong>CONNECT-UDP</strong>：客户端通过 HTTP Upgrade 或 Extended CONNECT（<code>:protocol = connect-udp</code>）请求代理到目标 UDP 套接字，代理把 HTTP Datagram 与 UDP 包互相转换，Context ID <code>0</code> 表示未修改的 UDP 负载，单个负载不得超过 65,527 字节（来源：RFC 9298）。</p>\n<p>这套机制对边缘平台的意义在于：可以在不看内容的前提下，把游戏、实时音视频、DNS 等 UDP 流量也纳入边缘的路径优化与访问控制，而不必自造私有隧道协议。</p>\n<p>在标准侧，ETSI 的 Multi-access Edge Computing（MEC）ISG 从运营商角度定义了开放边缘框架，目标是让应用跨多厂商基础设施与边缘服务商「无缝集成」，当前推进到 <strong>Phase 4 规范</strong>阶段（来源：etsi.org/technologies/multi-access-edge-computing）。它与云厂商的私有边缘网络平面互补——前者解决运营商侧互操作，后者解决互联网侧就近接入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>边缘网络平面由<strong>入口调度、节点数据面、回源互联</strong>三层组成，职责分离、失效模式互不相同，必须分开设计与监控。</li>\n<li>Anycast 提供无状态的粗粒度就近接入，Cloudflare 的 348 个城市与 13,000+ 互联网络是其生效的前提；但 BGP 不认时延，必须用社区标记、GSLB 兜底和实时选路修正。</li>\n<li>静态 anycast IP（如 AWS Global Accelerator）以「与 DNS 无关的确定性路由」规避 DNS 缓存导致的调度失效，并宣称最高 60% 的性能提升。</li>\n<li>数据面的价值在于把决策下沉到 XDP/eBPF，但规则热更新的原子性与健康检查闭环是真问题，不是可选项。</li>\n<li>分层缓存是回源成本的核心杠杆，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{origin} = R_{total}(1-h_e)(1-h_s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 显示两层叠加远优于单层优化；屏蔽层同时收敛源站连接数。</li>\n<li>QUIC 把建连往返压到 0–1 次，RFC 9297/9298 的 HTTP Datagrams 与 CONNECT-UDP 让任意 UDP 流量也能进入边缘优化路径。</li>\n<li>调度策略从不单独生效：入口 anycast、节点一致性哈希、节点间最少连接数是分层组合使用的关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"边缘网络平面、流量调度与回源互联","id":"边缘网络平面-流量调度与回源互联"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Anycast 与边缘入口调度","id":"anycast-与边缘入口调度"},{"level":2,"text":"数据面转发与可编程管线","id":"数据面转发与可编程管线"},{"level":2,"text":"流量调度策略：会话保持与负载分布","id":"流量调度策略-会话保持与负载分布"},{"level":2,"text":"回源互联与分层缓存","id":"回源互联与分层缓存"},{"level":2,"text":"传输层加速与 UDP 代理","id":"传输层加速与-udp-代理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"PoP 站点选址与边缘节点拓扑工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/edge-platform-architecture/pop-site-node-topology"},"next":{"title":"延迟预算驱动的就近算力放置模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/edge-cloud-platform-infrastructure/near-user-compute-scheduling/latency-aware-placement-model"}}